# curl and ca-certificates are genuinely build-time dependencies here, exactly
# as for tlosint-metagoofil: the upstream source is not on PyPI and is fetched
# over HTTPS by debian/rules (see debian/upstream.pin). They happen to be
# present in the build chroot already, but declaring them is the point.
